Hello,

Whether R is safe and where to find audits and certification data is a 
recurrent question to R-Help. And the answer is always the same, that 
they won't find it here.

Oracle's distribution of R [1] seems to be up to date but Microsoft 
retired its distribution years ago. From [2]:


Microsoft Machine Learning Server, previously called Microsoft R Server, 
will retire on July 1, 2022*. This date reflects a 12-month support 
extension, providing existing customers with the opportunity to migrate.
Microsoft R-Open (MRO) is Microsoft's distribution of the R runtime. 
